title: "kernel_calibration (KiTE): Kernel local calibration testing and recalibration"
abstract: >-
  A JAX library implementing the Kernel Local Calibration Error (KLCE) for testing
  whether a binary classifier is locally calibrated, localizing where it is
  miscalibrated, and recalibrating it.
